3. Jak wygląda przykładowe renderowanie kafelków/podkafelków?
jinja
Kopiuj
Edytuj
<div class="tiles-menu">
  {% for tile in tile_menu %}
    <button class="tile tile-{{ tile.id }} has-sub" id="tile-{{ tile.id }}">
      <span class="tile-icon">{{ tile.icon }}</span>
      <span>{{ tile.title }}</span>
      <span class="tile-badge">[{{ tile.count or "" }}]</span>
      <span class="sub-arrow">&#9650;</span>
    </button>
    <div class="sub-tiles tile-{{ tile.id }}" id="sub-tiles-{{ tile.id }}">
      {% for subtile in tile.subtiles %}
        <button class="sub-tile tile-{{ tile.id }}">
          <span class="tile-icon">{{ subtile.icon }}</span>
          {{ subtile.title }}
        </button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>